OL,3,ATrump signs order preventing future
OL,4,Apresidents from changing Oval Office
OL,5,
OL,6,F"So we're making it a national
OL,7,Fmonument, and it will not be allowed to
OL,8,Fbe touched by anybody, destroyed,
OL,9,Fripped down by stupid people, in order
OL,10,Fto build something in a slightly
OL,11,Fdifferent shape," Trump told reporters
OL,12,Fon Thursday.
OL,14,FAmerican presidents currently have the
OL,15,Fpower to make some changes to the White
OL,16,FHouse but large projects require the
OL,17,Fpermission of Congress.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
